      "lines": [
        "а）$(3^5)^x=3^{10}$；　　　　　　　б）$3^5\\cdot3^x=3^8$；",
        "в）$(5^x)^4=5^{12}$；　　　　　　　г）$5^x\\cdot5^4=5^{12}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "588",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "588．求所有能使下列语句变成真等式的自然数对$(x,y)$：",
        "а）$(2^x)^y=2^6$；　　　　　　　　б）$2^x\\cdot2^y=2^6$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "589",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "589．比较两数的大小：",
        "а）$3^8$和$27^3$；　　　　　　　　б）$8^9$和$2^{28}$；",
        "в）$25^5$和$125^3$；　　　　　　　г）$\\left(\\frac14\\right)^3$和$\\left(\\frac18\\right)^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "590",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "590．把下列各式写成$x^n$和$-x^n$的形式：",
        "а）$x^5\\cdot(x^2)^3$；　　　　　　　б）$(-x^3)^4\\cdot x^8$；",
        "в）$(x^4)^2\\cdot(-x^5)^3$；　　　　　г）$(-x^2)^3\\cdot(-x^3)^5$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复　习　题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "591",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "591．求两个集合的交集和并集：",
        "а）$[-1,4]$和$[2,7]$；　б）$]-\\infty,5]$和$[-2,+\\infty[$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "592",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "592．自然数的平方的末位数字只能是哪几个？四次幂呢？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "33．积的乘方"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "表达式$(ab)^8$表示的是因数$a$和$b$的积的乘方．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用乘法交换律和结合律，可以把$(ab)^8$写成因数的幂",
        "的积：",
        "$(ab)^8=\\underbrace{(ab)(ab)\\cdots(ab)}_{8\\text{个}}=\\underbrace{(a\\cdot a\\cdots a)}_{8\\text{个}}\\cdot\\underbrace{(b\\cdot b\\cdots b)}_{8\\text{个}}=a^8b^8$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所以，$(ab)^8=a^8b^8$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，积的八次幂等于各因数的八次幂的积．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "同样可以证明："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
